    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Under Dead</strong> is a challenging <strong>auto-shooter horde survivor roguelike</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every day it gets harder. Fight for your life!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty rises over time as you encounter not only more zombies but also new ones with special powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/d39ec1c07ba47a98a197096ce10a67b6.poster.avif?t=1749113843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/d39ec1c07ba47a98a197096ce10a67b6.webm?t=1749113843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/d39ec1c07ba47a98a197096ce10a67b6.mp4?t=1749113843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is unique</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies, items, weapons, abilities, and events are all randomly generated. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose from a variety of classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All classes start with different items, but that doesn\u2019t mean you have to stick to that playstyle for the entire game. By the end, your build might end up being completely different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/9686a1f44e8d62c13fa69f10667d4ad0.poster.avif?t=1749113843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/9686a1f44e8d62c13fa69f10667d4ad0.webm?t=1749113843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/9686a1f44e8d62c13fa69f10667d4ad0.mp4?t=1749113843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Under Dead</strong> is a challenging <strong>auto-shooter horde survivor roguelike</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every day it gets harder. Fight for your life!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty rises over time as you encounter not only more zombies but also new ones with special powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/d39ec1c07ba47a98a197096ce10a67b6.poster.avif?t=1749113843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/d39ec1c07ba47a98a197096ce10a67b6.webm?t=1749113843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/d39ec1c07ba47a98a197096ce10a67b6.mp4?t=1749113843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is unique</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies, items, weapons, abilities, and events are all randomly generated. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose from a variety of classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All classes start with different items, but that doesn\u2019t mean you have to stick to that playstyle for the entire game. By the end, your build might end up being completely different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/9686a1f44e8d62c13fa69f10667d4ad0.poster.avif?t=1749113843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/9686a1f44e8d62c13fa69f10667d4ad0.webm?t=1749113843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339050/extras/9686a1f44e8d62c13fa69f10667d4ad0.mp4?t=1749113843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Under Dead is a challenging zombie auto-shooter horde survivor roguelike. The dead have risen, and they get stronger every day, but so do you. Slay hordes of zombies, collect items, level up, and craft powerful builds. Survive as long as you can and become a zombie-killing machine!",
